+| Finding | V7.1 disposition | Verification or remaining limit |
+|---|---|---|
+| R1 false under general cumulative selection with sign-changing payoff gaps | Restricted to constant-speed replicator selection; the earlier positive-gap cumulative theorem remains | RP reproduces the viable nonlinear-selection counterexample and retained replicator case; S9/S14 record the boundary |
